  "label": "Man in the Image",
  "description": "The man in the image is Jussie Smollett, an actor known for his role in 'Empire'. The meme references his 2019 hoax case, where he falsely claimed to be the victim of a hate crime. The text 'if you play your cards right you can skip prison' is a reference to the public perception that he manipulated the situation to avoid legal consequences, which led to his conviction for felony obstruction of justice. This background knowledge is essential to understand the meme's context and intent.",
